# https://github.com/microcmsio/simple-blog-with-microcms
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) for `next dev`. Without the service and its
# key the blog is unconnected: it renders its sample posts (libs/sample.ts)
# under a notice. On stage and prod both are the product's Orun secrets, which
# the deploy pushes to the Worker as secrets; the pages read them per request,
# and no build ever sees them (README → Connect microCMS).
MICROCMS_SERVICE_DOMAIN=
MICROCMS_API_KEY=
# The site's public origin (metadataBase). The deploy sets it per environment;
# unset, it is http://localhost:3000.
BASE_URL=
